240-Typical packets:
241-- `Benchmark registry memo` for chapter-family inventory, cohort scope, or expected packet floor
242-- `Guide reflection benchmark memo` for question -> answer -> verification -> patch-target loops
243-- `Prompt-stack release review` when the benchmark is deciding release, rewrite acceptance, or parity preservation
244-- `Packet compliance report` when packet-floor doctrine or omission findings are the live surface
245-- `Context sufficiency review memo` or `Critique quality review memo` when weak context or no-gain iteration may explain benchmark instability
